| To HD install:
| 1. Copy !Lemmings to HD
| 2. Copy the floppy image as !Lemmings.F1022701
| 3. Replace the contents of !Lemmings.!Run with:
|  ADFBootFloppy F1022701
IfThere <Obey$Dir>.F1022701 THEN ADFMount <Obey$Dir>.F1022701
Set Obey$Dir ADFS::0.$.!Lemmings
StoreCSD
DIR <Obey$Dir>

Set Lem$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IF ADFFS$OSVersion>=&35000 THEN ADFRemapVideoMemory 9 80 ELSE ScreenSize 80
Echo <22><9>
HideCommandWindow
RMAFree 200
| Archimedes Live: use the game's own MusicModule, not ADFFS's MusMod2 on QTM.
| QTM's sound interrupt can run past VSync with IRQs off, which moves the
| palette change above the panel down the screen (e.g. while +/- is held)
RMEnsure MusicModule2 0 RMLoad <Lem$Dir>.MusMod2
Mussamplerate 3

IF ADFFS$CPUID<=3 THEN ADFWimpSlot 496k 664k ELSE ADFWimpSlot 664k
SetEval fix$up 0
IF ADFFS$CPUID>=&A10 OR ADFFS$OSVersion>=&35000 THEN SetEval fix$up 1
IF fix$up THEN GOARM3JIT 0
| Correct cursor plot code
IF fix$up THEN JITMEMORYA 243F4 E4960004 E2466909
IF fix$up THEN JITMEMORYA 243F8 E58F0078 E2466E45
IF fix$up THEN JITMEMORYA 243FC E5960000 E3A00601
IF fix$up THEN JITMEMORYA 24400 E58F0138 E5806000
IF fix$up THEN JITMEMORYA 24478 E8990007 EA036EE1
IF fix$up THEN JITMEMORYA 24540 E8890007 EA036EBC
IF fix$up THEN MEMA 100004 E51F600C E08FF006 >100010 E8990006 EAFC9118 E8990004 EAFC9116 E8990007 EAFC9114 E8990003 EAFC9112 E8990001 EAFC9110 E51F6040 E08FF006
IF fix$up THEN MEMA 100044 E8890006 EAFC913D E8890004 EAFC913B E8890007 EAFC9139 E8890003 EAFC9137 E8890001 EAFC9135

LOAD <Lem$Dir>.LemBoot 8000
| Correct T1 palette swap
IF ADFFS$OSVersion>=&50000 THEN MEMA 8008 7600
IF ADFFS$VIDC20 THEN MEMA 8008 5400 3C00

ADFClipScreen 40:27 0 16
GO 8000
ADFClipScreen
<Lem$Dir>.LrestMouse
IF fix$up THEN GOARM3JIT
IF ADFFS$OSVersion>=&35000 THEN ADFRemapVideoMemory
RMKill MusicModule2
FX 15 0
IF Lem$Speaker = 1 THEN *Speaker On
IF Lem$Speaker = 0 THEN *Speaker Off
UnSet Lem$Speaker
UnSet Lem$Dir
UnSet fix$up
RestoreCSD